\b What this software does on this machine \b0\par
\par
The connector reads data from local business applications that you configure (for example
Tally on localhost:9000) and sends the results to your own TrackOlap tenant over HTTPS. It
runs as a Windows service under a dedicated low-privilege account and stores its
configuration under %ProgramData%\\TrackOlap\\Connector.\par
